[Thinking]
**Designing CS:GO Website**

I'm focusing on building the core HTML structure for the CS:GO website, ensuring a sleek, tactical aesthetic. The hero section is my immediate priority, laying the groundwork for the entire user experience.
[/Thinking]

Creating a full-scale website for a game like CS:GO (now CS2) involves several pages. Below is a **single-page landing site** template that includes a navigation bar, a hero section, a news grid, and a footer. It uses modern CSS for a sleek, dark "gaming" aesthetic.

I have included the **HTML and CSS in one block** for easy copying. Save this code as `index.html`.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CS:GO | Global Offensive Tactical Shooter</title>
    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@400;700&family=Roboto:wght@300;400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        /* CSS VARIABLES */
        :root {
            --primary-orange: #de9b35;
            --dark-bg: #0b0e13;
            --card-bg: #161b22;
            --text-white: #ffffff;
            --text-gray: #a3a3a3;
            --accent-blue: #4a90e2;
        }

        /* RESET & BASE */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--dark-bg);
            color: var(--text-white);
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        h1, h2, h3, .logo {
            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        /* NAVIGATION */
        nav {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px 8%;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
            position: fixed;
            width: 100%;
            z-index: 1000;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--primary-orange);
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--primary-orange);
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        nav ul {
            display: flex;
            list-style: none;
        }

        nav ul li {
            margin-left: 30px;
        }

        nav ul li a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: white;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: 0.3s;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        nav ul li a:hover {
            color: var(--primary-orange);
        }

        /* HERO SECTION */
        .hero {
            height: 100vh;
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.6), rgba(0,0,0,0.6)), 
                        url('https://images.alphacoders.com/463/463585.jpg') no-repeat center center/cover;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 4rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            letter-spacing: 5px;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            max-width: 600px;
            color: var(--text-gray);
        }

        .btn {
            background-color: var(--primary-orange);
            color: black;
            padding: 15px 40px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-family: 'Orbitron';
            border-radius: 5px;
            transition: 0.3s;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background-color: white;
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        /* NEWS SECTION */
        .news-section {
            padding: 80px 8%;
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            border-left: 5px solid var(--primary-orange);
            display: inline-block;
            padding-left: 15px;
        }

        .news-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .news-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: 0.3s;
            border: 1px solid #333;
        }

        .news-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            border-color: var(--primary-orange);
        }

        .news-card img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 200px;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .news-content {
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .news-content h3 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: var(--primary-orange);
        }

        .news-content p {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--text-gray);
        }

        /* STATS SECTION */
        .stats {
            background: url('https://wallpaperaccess.com/full/159039.jpg') no-repeat center center/cover;
            padding: 100px 8%;
            text-align: center;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-around;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            background-attachment: fixed;
        }

        .stat-box h2 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            color: var(--primary-orange);
        }

        /* FOOTER */
        footer {
            background: #050505;
            padding: 50px 8%;
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 1px solid #333;
        }

        .footer-links {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .footer-links a {
            color: var(--text-gray);
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 15px;
        }

        .footer-links a:hover {
            color: white;
        }

        .copyright {
            color: #555;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
        }

        /* RESPONSIVE */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            nav ul { display: none; }
            .hero h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- NAVIGATION -->
    <nav>
        <a href="#" class="logo">CS:GO // LOGO</a>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="#home">HOME</a></li>
            <li><a href="#news">NEWS</a></li>
            <li><a href="#media">MEDIA</a></li>
            <li><a href="#esports">ESPORTS</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/730/CounterStrike_Global_Offensive/" class="btn" style="padding: 8px 15px; font-size: 12px;">PLAY FREE</a></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <!-- HERO SECTION -->
    <section class="hero" id="home">
        <h1>GLOBAL OFFENSIVE</h1>
        <p>Join the world's #1 competitive tactical first-person shooter. Experience intense 5v5 combat, legendary maps, and a skill-based matchmaking system.</p>
        <a href="#" class="btn">DOWNLOAD ON STEAM</a>
    </section>

    <!-- STATS SECTION -->
    <section class="stats">
        <div class="stat-box">
            <h2>24M+</h2>
            <p>ACTIVE PLAYERS</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-box">
            <h2>$100M+</h2>
            <p>PRIZE POOLS</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-box">
            <h2>20+</h2>
            <p>YEARS OF LEGACY</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- NEWS SECTION -->
    <section class="news-section" id="news">
        <h2 class="section-title">Latest Updates</h2>
        <div class="news-grid">
            <!-- Card 1 -->
            <div class="news-card">
                <img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718fGatRlyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg" alt="Update">
                <div class="news-content">
                    <h3>Operation Riptide</h3>
                    <p>New challenges, new maps, and all-new ways to play your favorite game modes.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Card 2 -->
            <div class="news-card">
                <img src="https://images.gnwcdn.com/2023/articles/2023-03-22-14-53/cs2-1.jpg/EG11/resize/1200x-1/quality/80/format/jpg" alt="Update">
                <div class="news-content">
                    <h3>The Transition to CS2</h3>
                    <p>Everything you need to know about the engine upgrade and tactical gameplay changes.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Card 3 -->
            <div class="news-card">
                <img src="https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/3381077/4006c07a0914da393d6d5336f0e2a33eb4f0169b.png" alt="Update">
                <div class="news-content">
                    <h3>Major Championship</h3>
                    <p>The legends return. Watch the best teams in the world compete for the trophy in Paris.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer>
        <div class="footer-links">
            <a href="#">Privacy Policy</a>
            <a href="#">Terms of Service</a>
            <a href="#">Support</a>
            <a href="#">Workshop</a>
        </div>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">Counter-Strike, the Counter-Strike logo, Steam, and the Steam logo are trademarks and/or registered trademarks of Valve Corporation.</p>
        <p class="copyright">&copy; 2023 Valve Corporation, all rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
```

### Key Features of this Template:
1.  **Orbitron Font:** Uses a "sci-fi/tactical" font via Google Fonts to match the CS:GO branding.
2.  **Responsive Grid:** The news section automatically shifts from 3 columns to 1 column on mobile phones.
3.  **Sticky Header:** The navigation bar stays at the top as you scroll.
4.  **Gaming Palette:** Uses the iconic CS:GO Orange (`#de9b35`) against dark backgrounds.
5.  **Hover Effects:** Cards and buttons have smooth scaling and color transitions to feel interactive.

### How to use:
*   **Images:** I used placeholder images from game wallpapers. For a real site, you should host your own images in an `images/` folder.
*   **Links:** Replace `#` with your actual page links or social media URLs.
*   **CS2:** Since Valve has replaced CS:GO with Counter-Strike 2 (CS2), I included a "Transition to CS2" news card to keep the site looking current.

